# 117/117 Service Health Requirement

The backend reports `STARTUP COMPLETE: N/117 services healthy` on boot. The target is **117/117 — ALL SYSTEMS NOMINAL**. Any change that reduces this count is a regression and must be fixed before deploying.

> Service #117 is `account_event_reconciler` (added 2026-05-17 as part of the user creation audit hook). It runs on every boot regardless of `ENABLE_USER_CREATION_HOOK`; when the flag is off it is a silent no-op so the count stays stable.

